
load @cluesurf/base/code/network/http
  find response

task read
  note async
  take response, like response
  take format, like text, fall text <text>

  save raw, read response/dock

  fork case, read format
    case text
      send back
        call raw/text
          note async
          halt kink
    case bytes
      send back
        call raw/bytes
          note async
          halt kink
    case json
      send back
        call raw/json
          note async
          halt kink
    case stream
      send back
        call raw/bytes-stream
